===Pronoun===
{{etymid|ru|pronoun}}
{{head|ru|pronoun|g=n-in-s}}

# {{sid|ru|everything}} [[everything]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] '''всё''' [[объясни́ли]].|They explained '''everything'''.}}
# {{n-g|Used in certain situations where in English "it" or "things" would be used. Has the approximate meaning of "the situation".}}
#: {{syn|ru|де́ло}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Всё''' [[не]] [[так]] [[про́сто]].|It isn't that simple.|lit='''Everything''' isn't that simple.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Всё''' [[идёт]] [[не]] [[по]] [[пла́ну]].|Things aren't going to plan.|lit='''Everything''' is going not according to plan.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Всё''' [[норма́льно]].|It's okay.|lit='''Everything''' is okay.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[у|У]] [[меня́]] '''всё''' [[хорошо́]].|I'm fine.|lit=For me '''everything''' is (going) well.}}
# {{sid|ru|comparative}} {{lb|ru|in the {{lg|genitive case}}}} {{n-g|used after {{lg|comparative|comparatives}} of adjectives or adverbs as one way to form the {{lg|superlative}}}}
#: {{syn|ru|все<q:usually when talking about people>|alt1=всех|id1=comparative|наибо́лее<q:with adjectives or adverbs; placed in front>|са́мый<q:with adjectives; placed in front>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[интере́снее]] '''всего́'''|most interesting|lit=more interesting '''than everything'''}} {{q|{{lg|genitive case}} is one way to indicate an object of comparison}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[лучше|Лу́чше]] '''всего́''' [[испо́льзовать]] [[компью́тер]].|subst=компью́тер//компью́тэр|It's best to use a computer.|lit=Better '''than everything''' is to use a computer.}}

